  "steps": [
    "Fry the sliced onions in 1 tbsp of the ghee until golden brown, cool and grind to a smooth paste with a little water.",
    "Marinate the chicken with the curd, ginger garlic paste, coriander powder, chilli powder and salt for 30 minutes.",
    "Heat the remaining ghee, add the cardamom, cloves, cinnamon and bay leaf, and let them sizzle for 20 seconds.",
    "Add the marinated chicken and cook on medium heat for 10 minutes until the moisture reduces.",
    "Stir in the onion paste and cashew paste and cook 5 minutes, then add the milk.",
    "Cover and simmer on low heat for 20 minutes until the chicken is tender and the gravy is creamy.",
    "Finish with the garam masala and kewra water and rest for 5 minutes before serving."
  ]
